				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Sabbah"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732030605,
					"content": "Which Darshan were you with, by the way?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732030606,
					"content": "Oh, I could talk for three whole days about that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030607,
					"content": "I was with Amurta and specialized in plant evolution, so you could say my work was evidence-based.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030608,
					"content": "That means it is impossible to reach new conclusions without new forms of evidence. Simply put, fossils are necessary for the study of historical plants.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030609,
					"content": "But there are only so many fossil samples available, and the Akademiya is limited in its ability to provide new ones.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030610,
					"content": "Those were the circumstances, yet the institute still demanded results.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030611,
					"content": "So some people would just take a previous study, revise or add something to it, and turn it in. You also find that quite pointless, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030612,
					"content": "In truth, we could make new discoveries for sure if we looked towards history and geography for new materials.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030613,
					"content": "Certain literary documents that Amurta would usually ignore could be used as well, though that would surely cross into Vahumana and Haravatat territory.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030614,
					"content": "I was not proficient in those fields, and requesting the related files was too troublesome, never mind working with their researchers...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030615,
					"content": "But I believe that if we could actually work together as a team, many questions of the past would finally be answered.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030616,
					"content": "It's a shame that we couldn't continue our collaboration attempts. I must say that people in Vahumana and Haravatat have very peculiar perspectives, though...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030617,
					"content": "I had to be very careful with my wording and phrasing in my submissions to them to avoid misunderstandings and misinterpretations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030618,
					"content": "Before I was kicked out of the Akademiya, I was still in the middle of an argument with someone from Haravatat. Now I can't even do that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030625,
					"content": "Ah, I just rambled for a long time... But it feels good.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030626,
					"content": "Before you got here, I really didn't have many friends, and it could get pretty lonely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030629,
					"content": "Very few people in the village are into gardening.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030630,
					"content": "...Well, that's not entirely true. An old man living to the north of the village also plowed a plot to grow flowers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030631,
					"content": "I've visited him before. He's a slightly eccentric old man.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030632,
					"content": "I saw him planting stones, but he insisted that they were flowers, and even kicked me out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030633,
					"content": "It must be lonely, living all by himself. I can understand that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030634,
					"content": "You helped me with my Sumeru Roses... Maybe you can help him with his plants too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732030635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				},
				{
					"id": 732030635,
					"content": "You and Paimon should visit him if you get a chance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Sabbah"
				}
			]
		},
